36839>>>>>>>        
36839>>>>>>>        Property UInteger   puiOptTimeCost      420000
36840>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
36841>>>>>>>    
36841>>>>>>>    Function CreatePasswordHash String sPassword String ByRef sHash Returns Boolean
36843>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
36843>>>>>>>        UInteger uiAlgo
36843>>>>>>>        Get peAlgorithm to uiAlgo
36844>>>>>>>        
36844>>>>>>>        Case Begin
36844>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_256)
36846>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_512)
36849>>>>>>>                Get CreatePasswordHashEx uiAlgo (puiSaltSize(Self)) sPassword (&sHash) (puiOptTimeCost(Self)) to bOk
36850>>>>>>>                Case Break
36851>>>>>>>            Case Else
36851>>>>>>>                Error 8710 "Invalid algorithm selected."
36852>>>>>>>>
36852>>>>>>>                Function_Return False
36853>>>>>>>        Case End
36853>>>>>>>        
36853>>>>>>>        Function_Return bOk
36854>>>>>>>    End_Function
