36855>>>>>>>    Function RequiredBufferSize Returns UBigInt
36857>>>>>>>        UBigInt ullSize
36857>>>>>>>        UInteger uiAlgo
36857>>>>>>>        Get peAlgorithm to uiAlgo
36858>>>>>>>        
36858>>>>>>>        Case Begin
36858>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_256)
36860>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_512)
36863>>>>>>>                Get RequiredBufferSizeEx uiAlgo (puiSaltSize(Self)) (puiOptTimeCost(Self)) to ullSize
36864>>>>>>>                Case Break
36865>>>>>>>            Case Else
36865>>>>>>>                Error 8710 "Invalid algorithm selected."
36866>>>>>>>>
36866>>>>>>>                Function_Return 0
36867>>>>>>>        Case End
36867>>>>>>>        
36867>>>>>>>        Function_Return ullSize
36868>>>>>>>    End_Function
36869>>>>>>>
36869>>>>>>>End_Class
