36870>>>>>Class cWebSessionManagerStandard is a cWebSessionManager
36871>>>>>    
36871>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
36873>>>>>        Handle hoObj
36873>>>>>        
36873>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
36875>>>>>        
36875>>>>>        Set pbSessionCookieHttpOnly to True
36876>>>>>        
36876>>>>>        Property Handle phoUserDD 0      // Handle to the WebAppUser DDO
36877>>>>>        Property Handle phoSessionDD 0   // Handle to the WebAppSession DDO  
36878>>>>>        Property Handle phoCrypto 0      // Handle to the PasswordHasher
36879>>>>>        
36879>>>>>        Get CreateNamed (RefClass(cWebAppUserDataDictionary)) 'oUserDD' to hoObj
36880>>>>>        Set phoUserDD to hoObj
36881>>>>>        
36881>>>>>        Get CreateNamed (RefClass(cWebAppSessionDataDictionary)) 'oSessionDD' to hoObj
36882>>>>>        Set DDO_Server of hoObj to (phoUserDD(Self))
36883>>>>>        Set phoSessionDD to hoObj
36884>>>>>        
